                                                "sense_id": "14e6b692-b545-3eb7-a4cb-dbc2b795e7a9",
                                                "text": "[H]e attempted to recover his importance, by haranguing upon the Roman highways, when Mr. Jolter desired the company to take notice of the fine pavement upon which they travelled from Paris into Flanders […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "920a6383-5682-48f3-b083-78596acaf793",
                                                "sense_id": "14e6b692-b545-3eb7-a4cb-dbc2b795e7a9",
                                                "text": "The antirunway munitions are specifically designed to cause maximum destruction to airfield pavements."
                                            }
                                        ]
